---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="GTAVI.AI privacy policy — no personal data collected, no cookies, privacy-first analytics via Plausible."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">

    <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">// Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600 mb-10">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">1. No Personal Data Collected</h2>
        <p>
          GTAVI.AI does not collect, store, or process any personally identifiable information.
          There is no account system, no login, and no forms that capture personal data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">2. Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site uses <a href="https://plausible.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-zinc-300 hover:text-gta-gold transition-colors">Plausible Analytics</a> —
          a privacy-first, cookieless analytics platform. Plausible does not use cookies, does not
          track individuals across sites, and does not collect or store personal data. All aggregate
          traffic data is anonymised. Full details at
          <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-zinc-300 hover:text-gta-gold transition-colors">plausible.io/data-policy</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">3. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not set any cookies. Plausible Analytics operates without cookies.
          No consent banner is required or displayed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
          The site loads assets from YouTube (thumbnail images for trailers) and Google Fonts.
          These services may set their own cookies or collect data per their respective privacy policies.
          We recommend reviewing
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-zinc-300 hover:text-gta-gold transition-colors">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">5. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This site links to external sources including YouTube, SEC EDGAR, Steam, and others.
          We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-300 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">6. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated at any time. As no personal data is collected, there are no
          material impacts on users from policy changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="border-t border-border-dim pt-6">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600">
          Questions about privacy? Contact us via the community channels linked on the site.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
